The apps' SDL layer (Döda Kvarter, the Store) on a two-screen handheld under a Wayland compositor (the AYN Thor under
ROCKNIX's sway): DK_SDL_LAYOUT=windows, a full-screen window for each screen, the bottom one's title ending in
"Bottom" (ROCKNIX's sway puts windows named so on its second output), each screen fitted in its own; a touch on
the bottom window taps the bottom screen. DK_TITLE names the windows.

